UID:35f05920-e7e2-4762-b81b-0b7698231665@35f0.org
DESCRIPTION:Read-only investigation completed. A mail sweep for Ads 
 notices\nwas cut off by a connector rate limit\, leaving part of the 
 day\nunseen. Desktop field core-web-vitals failed and worsened on\nthe 
 main section page\, mobile field data was absent across the\nchecked 
 URLs\, and one paper page was a clear lab-performance\noutlier. A 
 discrepancy between the day's top-paper list and the\nprior day's summary 
 was flagged to reconcile. Nothing applied.
DTSTAMP:20261015T063033Z
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261014
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261015
SUMMARY:MapleScholar brand search terms pull (read-only)
UID:86fe7702-1557-415d-b56a-6fe2dccebd65@86fe.org
DESCRIPTION:A user-requested pull of search terms and keywords for the 
 two\nbrand-defense campaigns was completed read-only and saved 
 as\nspreadsheets: nothing was added\, paused\, edited\, or 
 excluded.\nFinding: the top matched terms are generic scholarly 
 queries\nrather than brand terms\, matched via broad match\, and the\ntwo-
 word brand keyword exists in exact match only. A separate\ndiagnosis 
 follow-up on the account-level grant daily cap was\npresented with options
  and awaits the user's decision\; no\nbudget or setting was changed.
DTSTAMP:20261015T063033Z
END:VEVENT
