UID:78ee5496-7a38-4d1c-bbcf-3965c632699e@78ee.org
DESCRIPTION:The indexing run was first blocked on a phone approval 
 step\;\nthe user approved and the run resumed from the main chat. The\none
  discovered paper page was inspected and its indexing\nrequest was 
 rejected by the search engine\, which reported a\nfetch failure\, while a 
 direct check minutes later served the\npage normally — a crawler-specific 
 or intermittent failure\,\nnot a down page. The crawled chat URLs were 
 skipped untouched\nunder the permanent owner exclusion. Quota was not hit 
 and\nthe remaining list is unchanged.
DTSTAMP:20261015T063033Z
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=/ics.py/2020.1/America/Toronto:20261014T104600
DURATION:PT1H
SUMMARY:Comprehensive perfect-match job search completed: no perfect fits
UID:8a216b81-5ad7-460e-8066-a3aaad0a0ecb@8a21.org
DESCRIPTION:A user-directed comprehensive search was run against 
 the\nmaster v2 resume\, cover letter\, and glossary: 15 domain\nsub-tasks 
 executed strictly sequentially\, Canada city-by-city\nfirst\, then 
 worldwide hubs\, with every candidate verified on\nthe employer's own 
 posting. Result: zero perfect fits\, with\nseveral hundred near-misses 
 each recorded with its exact\nfail reason and coverage gaps stated. One 
 role was flagged\nfor a possible user exception decision. Research only 
 —\nnothing was applied and no employer was contacted.
DTSTAMP:20261015T063033Z
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
